# Explicit pin (not just a transitive dep of sqlalchemy): sqlalchemy's
# greenlet requirement is gated by a `platform_machine == "aarch64"` marker
# (Linux's name for arm64). macOS reports `arm64`, so pip-compile run on a
# Mac silently drops greenlet from the lock, then `pip install
# --require-hashes` fails inside the (Linux/aarch64) Docker image where the
# marker is true. Listing it directly forces it into the lock unconditionally.
greenlet
